// Signing settings for the app target.
//
// The development team is not committed: each developer sets it in Local.xcconfig, which is
// git-ignored. Copy Local.xcconfig.example to Local.xcconfig and fill in your team ID.
// Do not choose a team in Xcode's Signing & Capabilities pane: Xcode would write it into
// project.pbxproj, and CI rejects that.
//
// The "?" makes the include optional, so the project still builds for the simulator (and in
// CI) without the local file.

#include? "Local.xcconfig"
